umbriel: umbriel (A Wayland compositor built on wlroots)
umbriel: umbriel is a Wayland compositor / tiling window manager for
umbriel: daily use. It offers scrolling, dwindle, master and stacking
umbriel: layouts, per-output workspaces, window rules, blur, shadows and
umbriel: rounded corners with fluid animations, plus HDR and VRR.
umbriel: Written in C++23 on wlroots 0.20 with an in-tree scene graph.
